&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;This page contains all release notes and update records for the &lt;strong&gt;Code Unlimited&lt;/strong&gt; website. Here you can find the latest features, improvements, and fixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-about-release-notes"&gt;🎯 About Release Notes
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;strong&gt;continuous integration&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;version management&lt;/strong&gt; to maintain the site. Every important update is recorded here, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✨ &lt;strong&gt;New Features&lt;/strong&gt; - Brand new functionalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Improvements&lt;/strong&gt; - Enhancements to existing features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🐛 &lt;strong&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/strong&gt; - Various issue resolutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📊 &lt;strong&gt;Performance Boosts&lt;/strong&gt; - Speed and experience optimizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔒 &lt;strong&gt;Security Updates&lt;/strong&gt; - Security-related changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-how-to-read"&gt;🔍 How to Read
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each release note includes the following information:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📅 &lt;strong&gt;Release Date&lt;/strong&gt; - The specific date of the update&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏷️ &lt;strong&gt;Version Tag&lt;/strong&gt; - Easy-to-track version number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📊 &lt;strong&gt;Statistics&lt;/strong&gt; - Quantitative data on code changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📸 &lt;strong&gt;Showcase&lt;/strong&gt; - Before and after comparisons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📝 &lt;strong&gt;Usage Guide&lt;/strong&gt; - How to use new features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
